	(text "This is an eXternal Device (xd) version of cbmSD-mini\nthat is paired with the cbmSD-pass board which provides\npower and IEEE signals on one cable and also has a\npassthru for other standard devices via PET-IEEE cable.\n\nNotes:\n- V1.0  submitted 2020-08-19, JLCPCB\n\nChanges:\n- Initial release"
